          "draft": {
            "heroMessage": "Find Your Dream Home in Chattanooga with John Holden, Affiliate Broker.",
            "welcomeNote": "Welcome! With over 30 years of local experience, I’m here to make your home buying or selling journey in Chattanooga as smooth and rewarding as possible.",
            "tagline": "Dedicated service. Deep Chattanooga roots.",
            "aboutParagraph": "Having called the greater Chattanooga area home for three decades, I bring a diverse blend of professional experience to every client relationship. My background includes service in the Marine Corps, work as a loan officer, and time as a general manager in hospitality. As an affiliate broker with Realty One Group Experts, I provide the knowledge, commitment, and state-of-the-art tools you need to achieve your real estate goals. Whether you’re buying, selling, or just exploring your options, my approach is hands-on, transparent, and entirely client-focused.",
