  "reviewText": "Back\nAPP BUILDER\njohnholdenhomes.com\nChange\nHere’s your app\nYour branding, content and listings are ready to review. Explore themes or preview your app before publishing.\nCHATTANOOGA, TN\nFind Your Dream Home in Chattanooga\nChattanooga-based John Holden Homes are a realtor / broker dedicated to helping you achieve your real estate goals at the highest standards.\nView listings\nHomes I picked\nfor you.\nNew listings will appear here as your realtor adds them. Get in touch to discuss your search.\n423-314-8761\nguest+realtor+62730dcd-b580-4313-ab4c-b32d29a8e7ee@guest.myrealtor.app\nRealty One Group Experts\nHome\nListings\nSaved\nChat\nProfile\nMy Website · how your clients will see the opening screen\nOPENING LINE\nFind Your Dream Home in Chattanooga with John Holden, Affiliate Broker.\nTry another opening line\nYOUR INTRODUCTION\nHaving called the greater Chattanooga area home for three decades, I bring a diverse blend of professional experience to every client relationship. My background includes service in the Marine Corps, work as a loan officer, and time as a general manager in hospitality. As an affiliate broker with Realty One Group Experts, I provide the knowledge, commitment, and state-of-the-art tools you need to achieve your real estate goals. Whether you’re buying, selling, or just exploring your options, my approach is hands-on, transparent, and entirely client-focused.\nTry another introduction\nBring in your listings\nPaste the page where your listings live. We’ll figure out the rest.\nImport my listings\nWe couldn’t find your listings on that page. Try pasting the page where all of your active listings are shown. The page must open without signing in.\nAdd your portrait\nRecommended — your app opens on your photo.\nChoose a photo\nPlease confirm\nWe found these — fix anything that’s wrong.\nPhone\nAlso found: 423-541-0100\n▸ Brokerage & license (optional)\n✓ Realty One Group Experts\nMake it yours\nExplore themes with your imported content and listings, or preview the client experience. Publish whenever you’re ready.\nExplore Themes\nPreview My App\nPublish My App",
